WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The demonstration starts from nothing: the local Kubernetes scope, with no cluster and nothing deployed.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Deploy starts minikube on Docker Desktop. The Activity feed streams the log with a live timer.

3
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Minikube starts its control plane and enables storage, metrics and the default storage class.

4
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:46.000
The Containers tab shows the Kubernetes system pods coming up while the deployment continues.

5
00:01:46.000 --> 00:02:05.000
The cluster is deployed in 1 minute 36 seconds.

6
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:28.000
Containers now shows every system pod running.

